       "24x24": "https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/5fca89ef2730d8007611dc7c/707b4d6e-d492-453c-8971-886c16de2299/24",
       "32x32": "https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/5fca89ef2730d8007611dc7c/707b4d6e-d492-453c-8971-886c16de2299/32",
       "48x48": "https://avatar-management--avatars.us-west-2.prod.public.atl-paas.net/5fca89ef2730d8007611dc7c/707b4d6e-d492-453c-8971-886c16de2299/48"
      },
      "displayName": "David Wilcox",
      "self": "https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/user?accountId=5fca89ef2730d8007611dc7c",
      "timeZone": "America/Halifax"
     },
     "body": "<p>I reviewed the test documentation and made a few edits. In general this looks really good and I was able to run the tests locally. A couple notes:</p>\n<ol>\n\t<li>There is a <em>template needed</em> note at the bottom of the Python OCFL Validator page: <a href=\"https://wiki.lyrasis.org/display/FF/Test+Guide+-+Python+OCFL+Validator\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://wiki.lyrasis.org/display/FF/Test+Guide+-+Python+OCFL+Validator</a></li>\n\t<li>There are a couple <em>template needed</em> notes on the migration-utils page: <a href=\"https://wiki.lyrasis.org/display/FF/Test+Guide+-+Fedora+3+to+6+Migration+Tooling\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://wiki.lyrasis.org/display/FF/Test+Guide+-+Fedora+3+to+6+Migration+Tooling</a></li>\n</ol>\n\n\n<p>We can either create these templates as part of this ticket or close this ticket and open a new one.</p>",
     "created": "15/Jul/20 4:01 PM",
     "id": "21344",
     "jsdPublic": true,
     "self": "https://fedora-repository.atlassian.net/rest/api/3/issue/13324/comment/21344",
